5785","title":"WALL-E: World Alignment by NeuroSymbolic Learning improves World Model-based LLM Agents"},{"raw_text":"ZijianZhou\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tAoQu\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tZhaoxuanWu\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tSunghwanKim\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tAlokPrakash\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tDanielaRus\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tJinhuaZhao\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tBryan Kian HsiangLow\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tPaulPuLiang\n\t\t\n\t\tarXiv:2506.15841\n\t\tMem1: Learning to synergize memory and reasoning for efficient long-horizon agents\n\t\t\n\t\n\tarXiv preprint","doi":null,"arxiv_id":"2506.15841","title":null},{"raw_text":"ZhengZhu\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tXiaofengWang\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tWangboZhao\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tChenMin\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tNianchenDeng\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tMinDou\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tYuqiWang\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tBotianShi\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tKaiWang\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tChiZhang\n\t\t\n\t\tarXiv:2405.03520\n\t\tIs sora a world simulator? a comprehensive survey on general world models and beyond\n\t\t\n\t\t\t2024\n\t\t\n\t\n\tarXiv preprint","doi":null,"arxiv_id":"2405.03520","title":null},{"raw_text":"Rt-2: Visionlanguage-action models transfer web knowledge to robotic control\n\t\t\n\t\t\tBriannaZitkovich\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tTianheYu\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tSichunXu\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tPengXu\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tTedXiao\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tFeiXia\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tJialinWu\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tPaulWohlhart\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tStefanWelker\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tAyzaanWahid\n\t\t\n\t\tPMLR\n\t\n\t\n\t\tConference on Robot Learning\n\t\t\n\t\t\t2023","doi":null,"arxiv_id":null,"title":"Rt-2: Visionlanguage-action models transfer web knowledge to robotic control"}],"layout_json":null,"tei_xml":"<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?>\n<TEI xml:space=\"preserve\" xmlns=\"http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0\" \nxmlns:xsi=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance\" \nxsi:schemaLocation=\"http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0 https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kermitt2/grobid/master/grobid-home/schemas/xsd/Grobid.xsd\"\n xmlns:xlink=\"http: